<title>USA: TransAmerican in $13.6 mln acquisition.</title>
<headline>TransAmerican in $13.6 mln acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransAmerican Waste Industries Inc said it had acquired certain assets of USA Waste Services Inc, for $13.6 million in cash and warrants to purchase 1.5 million shares of TransAmerican Waste common stock.</p>
<p>The acquisition will nearly double the size of TransAmerican, the company said, by adding about $15 million of annual revenue, making it one of the largest hauling companies in greater Houston.</p>
</text>
